OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people in Gloucester host
OL,4,Afirst TEDx event
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucester is set to host its
OL,7,Ffirst-ever TEDx event, organised
OL,8,Fentirely by a team of young people from
OL,9,Fthe city.
OL,11,FTEDx Eastgate Street will be held at
OL,12,FGloucester Guildhall on Sunday 20
OL,13,FSeptember and will see 12 speakers
OL,14,Fshowcasing ideas, experiences and
OL,15,Fstories based on this year's theme -
OL,16,Fentitled "Merge: When Stories Meet,
OL,17,FCommunities Grow".
OL,19,FThe event has been organised by people
OL,20,Faged between 18 and 35 with most of the
OL,21,Fspeakers also having strong links to
OL,22,FGloucester.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
