OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people in Gloucester host
OL,4,Afirst TEDx event
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-lead organiser Tia Callum said she
OL,7,Fwas "excited" to bring TEDx to the city
OL,8,Fand hoped it would help to "challenge
OL,9,Fperceptions around what young people
OL,10,Fcan be capable of achieving".
